<title>INDIA: TABLE-India BSES 1996/97 net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-India BSES 1996/97 net up.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	 2,133.0    vs    1,734.7</p>
<p>    Div (in rupees)	3.0    vs	  2.8</p>
<p>    Total income    18,999.3    vs   15,848.5</p>
<p>    Net sales	 17,720.7    vs   15,012.0</p>
<p>    Expenditure     14,372.9    vs   12,684.5</p>
<p>    Other Income     1,278.6    vs	836.5</p>
<p>    Interest	   1,128.7    vs	705.8</p>
<p>    Depreciation     1,314.6    vs	723.4</p>
<p>    Tax		     50.1    vs	  0.1</p>
<p>    Shr (in rupees)     15.06   vs	 15.29</p>
<p>Note: BSES Ltd is an Indian power generator and supplier that provides electricity to much of India's financial capital. The firm said the results were audited.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
